{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emberlands: Desktop Village</strong> is a cozy idle village builder designed to sit anywhere on your screen while you work on other tasks.<br>Set in the colorful world of <i>Into the Emberlands</i>, you\u2019ll collect resources, unlock your favorite buildings and characters, and grow a village that\u2019s uniquely yours \u2014 all while a little knack roams around your screen for resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/eb12b21d4141dae59a823df5e3f0bc18.poster.avif?t=1764341436\" width=780 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/eb12b21d4141dae59a823df5e3f0bc18.webm?t=1764341436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/eb12b21d4141dae59a823df5e3f0bc18.mp4?t=1764341436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your tiny co-worker</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the game anywhere on your screen and the little knack will keep you company. As he explores, he\u2019ll gather resources for you \u2014 use them to unlock new placeable tiles and expand your floating village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/416b6b799049f88163a90d2c4d80cc01.poster.avif?t=1764341436\" width=780 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/416b6b799049f88163a90d2c4d80cc01.webm?t=1764341436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/416b6b799049f88163a90d2c4d80cc01.mp4?t=1764341436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your perfect village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more resources your knack collects, the more your world will grow. Place tiles on multiple levels and design your own little corner of the Emberlands. Whether you want a bustling town or a quiet meadow, it\u2019s completely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/4a3de2bf83324fcb6e3f7c3267a8ec29.poster.avif?t=1764341436\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/4a3de2bf83324fcb6e3f7c3267a8ec29.webm?t=1764341436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/4a3de2bf83324fcb6e3f7c3267a8ec29.mp4?t=1764341436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect ember</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically arrange your buildings to boost ember production. And with your ember, you can upgrade your little knack buddy, or discover more different tiles to place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/f4d3780016599cd50767330868f4d632.poster.avif?t=1764341436\" width=780 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/f4d3780016599cd50767330868f4d632.webm?t=1764341436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/extras/f4d3780016599cd50767330868f4d632.mp4?t=1764341436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover new tiles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the prize wheel to discover over 60 tiles across multiple collections. Each set adds a different vibe and look for your floating village!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997390?t=1764341436","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997390?t=1764341436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/1c18170fd07da8dcf2cbf60ebf8d938c903f41fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764341436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997390/1c18170fd07da8dcf2cbf60ebf8d938c903f41fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764341436","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emberlands: Desktop Village</strong> is a cozy idle village builder designed to sit anywhere on your screen while you work on other tasks.<br>Set in the colorful world of <i>Into the Emberlands</i>, you\u2019ll collect resources, unlock your favorite buildings and characters, and grow a village that\u2019s uniquely yours \u2014 all while a little knack roams around your screen for resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st